commit 51965589c7ec64c5fe5fb81b20d5edacb1ebf856
Author: Aleksandr Beshkenadze <beshkenadze@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Apr 8 17:22:58 2026 +0300

    fix: Kokoro 8-bit crash on quantized weight layout and NaN durations (#136)
    
    * fix: Kokoro 8-bit crash on quantized weight layout and NaN durations
    
    - skip 3D weight transposition in sanitize() for quantized checkpoints
      (MLX-converted weights are already in (out, kernel, in) layout)
    - guard duration pipeline against NaN propagation from quantized encoder
    - cap duration values at 100 to prevent OOM from garbage int32 casts
    - return silence instead of crashing on empty indices
    
    Fixes #135
    
    * refactor: hoist isQuantized check, name magic number, add clarifying comments
    
    * refactor: detect quantized Kokoro checkpoints from weights

